Senjatamu yang keras dan legendaris...

1624
01:29:12,521 --> 01:29:14,870
Maaf. Maaf.

1625
01:29:19,049 --> 01:29:21,093
Pakai pelindung selangkangan.

1626
01:29:23,227 --> 01:29:24,662
Harus pakai pelindung selangkangan?
Apa--

1627
01:29:24,663 --> 01:29:26,447
- Kamu yakin?
- Ya.

1628
01:29:26,448 --> 01:29:28,100
- Aktingmu meyakinkan sekali.
- Terima kasih banyak, Olivia.

1629
01:29:28,101 --> 01:29:29,754
Hebat sekali.

1630
01:29:29,755 --> 01:29:31,539
Tidak, rasanya auranya
tidak pas.

1631
01:29:31,540 --> 01:29:33,018
- Sial.
- Astaga.

1632
01:29:36,849 --> 01:29:38,068
Melihatmu.

1633
01:29:39,025 --> 01:29:40,112
Aku sedang melihatmu.

1634
01:29:40,113 --> 01:29:41,506
Sudah kuduga.

1635
01:29:41,811 --> 01:29:42,812
Sudah kuduga.

1636
01:29:45,728 --> 01:29:46,990
Oke.

1637
01:29:48,731 --> 01:29:50,209
Oke.

1638
01:29:50,210 --> 01:29:52,952
Greg, aku akan melakukannya
tepat di depan kamera.

1639
01:29:59,176 --> 01:30:00,177
Maaf, katakan sekali lagi?

1640
01:30:00,482 --> 01:30:02,265
Tentu.

1641
01:30:02,266 --> 01:30:03,659
Oke?

1642
01:30:07,750 --> 01:30:09,229
Dia sangat manipulatif.

1643
01:30:09,665 --> 01:30:12,145
Aku tahu.